{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c23e7b24-c69f-44cf-a52e-00985d1590f7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"# BENCH-007: Cache Invalidation \u0026 Billing Precision Regression\n\nThe task has been completed in strict accordance with the 4-stage ICM contract.\n\n### 1. Intake \u0026 Scope\n- Examined the four target files (`store.py`, `cache.py`, `billing.py`, and `api.py`) and test suite (`tests/test_visible.py`).\n- Kept all edits strictly confined to these four target modules.\n\n### 2. Plan\n- **`store.py` (`TenantStore`)**:\n  - Store tier rates as `Decimal` instances.\n  - Implement version tracking (`version = 1` for new tenants, incremented by 1 on update or usage recording).\n  - Fire invalidation hooks on tier updates (`tenant_id, None`), tenant upsert updates (`tenant_id, None`), and usage mutations (`tenant_id, period`).\n  - Enforce validation for `units \u003e= 0` and `unit_rate \u003e= 0`.\n  - Provide defensive deep copies in `get_tenant` and `get_snapshot`.\n- **`cache.py` (`InvoiceCache`)**:\n  - Key entries by `(tenant_id, period)`.\n  - Check version on `get(tenant_id, period, version=...)`, returning `None` if version mismatches.\n  - Deep copy on `set` and `get` so external mutation cannot contaminate cached entries.\n  - Fix `invalidate(tenant_id, period)`: remove single `(tenant_id, period)` when specified (returning 1 or 0), or remove all periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None` (returning count removed).\n- **`billing.py` (`calculate_invoice`)**:\n  - Use `decimal.Decimal` and `quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP)` for all arithmetic.\n  - Validate snapshot match `(tenant_id, period, version)` before returning a cached invoice copy without re-discounting; recompute authoritatively if missing or stale.\n  - Compute `line_total` per line, `subtotal = sum(line_totals)`, `discount_amount = subtotal * discount_rate`, and `total = subtotal - discount_amount`.\n- **`api.py` (`BillingAPI`)**:\n  - Register `cache.invalidate` as invalidation hook on `store`.\n  - Wire `record_usage`, `preview_invoice`, and `change_tier_and_preview` with versioned cache lookups and defensive copies.\n\n### 3. Diff-Only Exec\n- Applied targeted modifications exclusively to `store.py`, `cache.py`, `billing.py`, and `api.py`.\n\n### 4. Verify\n- Ran pytest (`python -m pytest tests/`), passing visible smoke tests.\n- Executed comprehensive automated invariant checks verifying version increments, hook triggering, defensive copying against caller mutations, Decimal ROUND_HALF_UP precision, cache invalidation, and end-to-end API workflows.\n","duration_seconds":79.9880029,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":57991,"output_tokens":8897,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":341865,"total_tokens":66888}}}
